<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2002/07/04 (木) 11:32:30 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:mk8426@cocoromail.com">ｍｋ８４２６</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200207044113230_log_koukei.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200207044113230"></font>
